{"id": "68111", "title": "律师老公，离婚吧", "author": "薛小狸", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68111.htm", "intro": "父母之命，她无奈下嫁。\r\n直到婚礼的前一天，她才得知。\r\n未来的丈夫。不仅是某家上市公司的幕后老板，还是A市中最有影响力的律师。\r\n即便如此，嫁入豪门等是她还是不敢想。\r\n更何况，那男人根本就不爱她，娶她不过想去堵住悠悠之口，和给告别相亲找个正当理由而已。\r\n她何等无辜？\r\n婚礼上，他粗鲁的将婚戒套上她的左手无名指上。\r\n她怒了，这男人到底在不满什么？\r\n别忘了，她的损失最大好不好", "base": "files/article/html/68/68111", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "10509669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-15", "file": "10509670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-23", "file": "10509671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-29", "file": "10509672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-36", "file": "10509673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-45", "file": "10509674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-54", "file": "10509675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-61", "file": "10509676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "62-69", "file": "10509677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "70-76", "file": "10509678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-82完结", "file": "10509679.html", "available": false}]}